source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A marker of another unordered type at the same depth closes the list and opens a new one; JFM has one bullet, so the two lists read as bullets either way.
-- input.jira --
* a
- b
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li>a</li>
</ul>
<ul class="alternate" type="square">
	<li>b</li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- a

- b
-- warnings.json --
[]
